1
00:00:11,255 --> 00:00:13,785
June fifteenth, two thousand and four
二零零四年六月十五日，

2
00:00:14,015 --> 00:00:18,015
A day for junior high graduates to sign their yearbooks
這天是國中畢業生在畢業紀念冊簽名的日子，

3
00:00:18,015 --> 00:00:20,615
A day to leave their memories behind
留下屬於他們的回憶，

4
00:00:20,615 --> 00:00:23,865
And the beginning of our hero's story
也是我們故事主角的起點，

5
00:00:24,035 --> 00:00:26,375
The Plumbing God, Tu San-Jie
塗神，塗三傑，

6
00:00:26,375 --> 00:00:31,315
Known to the world as Brother Tu!
江湖人稱塗哥！

7
00:00:31,315 --> 00:00:34,195
Brother Tu was eating at a snack shop in Taichung
塗哥正在台中的小吃店用餐，

8
00:00:34,195 --> 00:00:35,635
His friend pointed at the TV
同行指著電視，

9
00:00:35,635 --> 00:00:37,385
"Taipei's got a student movement!
「台北發生學生運動！

10
00:00:37,835 --> 00:00:39,055
The Sunflower Movement!"
太陽花學運！」

11
00:00:39,055 --> 00:00:41,875
Brother Tu said, "Politics? I don't understand!
塗哥說：「政治？我不懂！

12
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:46,875
Let's go buy some sun cakes instead!"
不如去買太陽餅吧！」

13
00:00:46,875 --> 00:00:48,765
"I heard Brother Feng say
「我聽鋒兄說，

14
00:00:49,075 --> 00:00:50,115
Changhua's famous for sunflowers!
彰化以向日葵聞名！

15
00:00:50,115 --> 00:00:52,255
Next month let's visit a farm
下個月一起去農場，

16
00:00:52,255 --> 00:00:55,035
And enjoy a little sunshine!"
享受一點陽光吧！」

17
00:00:55,035 --> 00:00:57,855
His friend's work instincts kicked right in
同行的職業病立刻發作，

18
00:00:57,855 --> 00:01:00,655
Talking farm construction like a king!
談起農場施工，簡直頭頭是道！

19
00:01:00,655 --> 00:01:05,115
Brother Feng's Little History Class!
鋒兄歷史小學堂！

20
00:01:05,115 --> 00:01:06,505
Apprentice Lin said,
林學徒說，

21
00:01:06,635 --> 00:01:09,095
"AI robots might replace plumbers someday!
「AI 機器人有一天可能取代水電工！

22
00:01:09,095 --> 00:01:11,315
I'm so worried, what can I do?"
我好擔心，該怎麼辦？」

23
00:01:11,315 --> 00:01:12,385
Brother Tu said,
塗哥說，

24
00:01:12,495 --> 00:01:13,915
"But Brother Feng told me
「可是鋒兄告訴我，

25
00:01:13,915 --> 00:01:15,735
That's the future, not today!
那是未來，不是現在！

26
00:01:15,735 --> 00:01:18,455
Just focus on the work in front of you!"
先專心做好眼前的工作！」

27
00:01:18,455 --> 00:01:19,245
Brother Tu said,
塗哥說，

28
00:01:19,315 --> 00:01:22,035
"I've got a classmate who's deputy mayor in Taipei!"
「我有個同學在台北當副市長！」

29
00:01:22,035 --> 00:01:23,145
His friend replied,
同行回答，

30
00:01:23,155 --> 00:01:24,335
"You mean Brother Feng?"
「你是說鋒兄？」

31
00:01:24,335 --> 00:01:26,975
"Brother Feng? No way!
「鋒兄？不可能！

32
00:01:26,975 --> 00:01:28,395
He's a regional manager
他是區域經理，

33
00:01:28,395 --> 00:01:29,895
At Green Papaya Bubble Tea!
在青木瓜手搖飲！

34
00:01:29,895 --> 00:01:32,335
The deputy mayor is Huang Xin-Feng!"
副市長是黃馨鋒！」

35
00:01:32,335 --> 00:01:33,565
His friend said,
同行說，

36
00:01:33,635 --> 00:01:35,095
"Oh, I thought you meant Brother Feng!
「喔，我還以為你指鋒兄！

37
00:01:35,095 --> 00:01:38,035
Their names both have Feng in them!"
他們的名字都有個鋒字！」

38
00:01:38,035 --> 00:01:40,615
"By the way, won't your classmate
「對了，你那位同學，

39
00:01:40,615 --> 00:01:42,835
Run for mayor of Taipei?"
不參選台北市長嗎？」

40
00:01:42,835 --> 00:01:43,955
Brother Tu said,
塗哥說，

41
00:01:43,955 --> 00:01:46,505
"My classmate wrote a book about plumbers!
「我同學寫了一本水電工的書！

42
00:01:46,975 --> 00:01:49,295
He says he'll only have a chance to run
他說只有達到銷量門檻，才有參選的機會，

43
00:01:49,295 --> 00:01:52,805
When sales pass two point five million copies!"
那就是賣出超過兩百五十萬冊！」

44
00:01:55,035 --> 00:01:57,125
Someone at Taipei Zoo
有人在台北動物園，

45
00:01:57,495 --> 00:01:58,715
Started singing in a flash mob!
開始快閃唱歌！

46
00:01:58,715 --> 00:02:00,995
"The zoo's going crazy!"
「動物園不得了啦！」

47
00:02:00,995 --> 00:02:03,405
Crayon Shin-chan on the scene!
蠟筆小新登場！

48
00:02:03,495 --> 00:02:04,035
Brother Tu said,
塗哥說，

49
00:02:04,035 --> 00:02:06,445
"Japanese? I don't understand!
「日文？我不懂！

50
00:02:06,835 --> 00:02:08,395
Let's go to KTV
我們去 KTV，

51
00:02:08,395 --> 00:02:13,385
And sing Happy Paradise instead!"
改唱《快樂天堂》吧！」

52
00:02:14,135 --> 00:02:15,365
"Chairman Tu!
「塗董！

53
00:02:15,815 --> 00:02:18,345
Have you seen that hit TV drama?
你看過那齣熱門電視劇嗎？

54
00:02:18,715 --> 00:02:21,025
Plumbing Love is everywhere!
《水電情》紅遍各地！

55
00:02:21,175 --> 00:02:22,415
They say it's based on Tu Wei-Jie!"
聽說是以塗偉傑為原型！」

56
00:02:22,415 --> 00:02:23,605
"Tu Wei-Jie?
「塗偉傑？

57
00:02:24,755 --> 00:02:27,105
My name is Tu San-Jie!
我叫塗三傑！

58
00:02:27,315 --> 00:02:29,585
Only one character apart!
名字只差一個字！

59
00:02:29,875 --> 00:02:32,645
Maybe he's my distant relative!"
也許他是我的遠房親戚！」

60
00:02:33,115 --> 00:02:33,615
"Seriously?
「真的嗎？

61
00:02:34,135 --> 00:02:36,845
Your Tu family dominates the plumbing world!
你們塗家壟斷了水電業！

62
00:02:37,495 --> 00:02:38,975
Isn't that a little too much?"
是不是有點太誇張？」

63
00:02:38,975 --> 00:02:40,895
"Chairman Tu!
「塗董！

64
00:02:40,895 --> 00:02:43,285
Did you hear Tu Wei-Jie's so famous
你知道塗偉傑紅到，

65
00:02:43,715 --> 00:02:46,355
He's in vocational school Chinese textbooks?"
被寫進高職國文教科書嗎？」

66
00:02:46,355 --> 00:02:48,865
"Whoa, no way!
「哇，不會吧！

67
00:02:49,545 --> 00:02:52,875
Tu Wei-Jie must be my distant relative!
塗偉傑一定是我遠房親戚！

68
00:02:52,875 --> 00:02:55,675
Even the cats are speechless!
連貓咪都傻眼！

69
00:02:55,675 --> 00:02:59,155
I bet Brother Feng's cat would be stunned!"
我敢說鋒兄家的貓也會驚呆！」

70
00:02:59,155 --> 00:03:01,695
Phenomenal Plumber Brother Tu!
現象級水電工塗哥！

71
00:03:01,695 --> 00:03:04,015
An exclusive interview!
獨家專訪！

72
00:03:04,015 --> 00:03:05,725
The Plumbing God!
塗神！

73
00:03:05,895 --> 00:03:07,615
The Prince of Spin-Off Stories!
衍生故事的王子！

74
00:03:07,615 --> 00:03:10,495
Vocational Chinese textbooks!
高職國文教科書！

75
00:03:10,495 --> 00:03:11,915
Plumbing everywhere!
到處都是水電！

76
00:03:11,915 --> 00:03:15,155
TV drama: Falling for a Plumber!
電視劇：《愛上水電工》！

77
00:03:15,155 --> 00:03:18,175
Theme song lyrics by Brother Feng!
主題曲歌詞由鋒兄創作！

78
00:03:18,175 --> 00:03:20,415
Classic scenes from the novel!
小說中的經典場景！

79
00:03:20,415 --> 00:03:23,625
Sponsored by Green Papaya Four-Wood Tea!
青木瓜四木飲贊助播出！

80
00:03:23,675 --> 00:03:24,875
Brother Feng and Brother Tu
鋒兄與塗哥，

81
00:03:24,875 --> 00:03:26,175
Drank a whole year's supply!
喝了一整年份的飲料！

82
00:03:26,175 --> 00:03:28,875
So much they nearly threw up!
多到兩人差點吐出來！

83
00:03:28,875 --> 00:03:31,995
The movie: The Plumbing Tycoon!
電影：《水電工大老闆》！

84
00:03:31,995 --> 00:03:34,535
Academic citations everywhere!
學術引用遍地開花！

85
00:03:34,535 --> 00:03:36,955
A master's thesis in sociology
社會學碩士論文，

86
00:03:36,955 --> 00:03:39,415
Quotes The Plumbing God, Plumbing Prince!
引用《塗神水電王子》！

87
00:03:39,415 --> 00:03:41,835
Taiwanese Society in Literature
文學中的台灣社會，

88
00:03:41,835 --> 00:03:44,575
Of the Early Twenty-First Century!
呈現於二十一世紀前期！

89
00:03:44,575 --> 00:03:47,295
A doctoral thesis in Chinese literature
國文學博士論文，

90
00:03:47,295 --> 00:03:50,055
Quotes The Plumbing God, Plumbing Prince!
引用《塗神水電王子》！

91
00:03:50,055 --> 00:03:52,715
Taiwanese Political Figures
台灣政治人物，

92
00:03:52,715 --> 00:03:55,335
As Representative Writers
作為代表作家，

93
00:03:55,335 --> 00:03:57,675
And Studies of Their Works!
以及他們的作品研究！

94
00:03:57,675 --> 00:04:00,915
Brother Tu, the Plumbing Prince, goes viral!
塗哥水電王子爆紅！

95
00:04:00,915 --> 00:04:03,975
Brother Feng makes thirty-three point three billion!
鋒兄賺三百三十三億！

96
00:04:03,975 --> 00:04:08,005
Brother Tu makes three hundred million!
塗哥賺三億！

97
00:04:08,355 --> 00:04:13,985
The legend keeps on rolling!
這個傳奇還在繼續！
